<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Arcadian Corp cut to hold.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Arcadian Corp cut to hold.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- UBS Securities said it downgraded Arcadian Corp to hold from buy.</p>
<p>-- Said shares met price target on merger agreement with Potash Corp of Saskatchewan Inc.</p>
<p>-- Shares unchanged at 24-1/2.</p>
<p>-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730</p>
</text>
